            "value": "DiPalma, M., Rauch-Williams, T., Fraser, J., & Munakata Marr, J. (2014). Operational Strategies for Promoting Nitrogen Elimination in Centrate Side Stream Treatment. Proceedings of the Water Environment Federation, 2014(9), 5206-5214. http://doi.org/10.2175/193864714815941081 ",
            "type": "citation/reference",
